            "text": "Sampled rectangle agreement is intentionally not promoted to source-exact status. Pinned Blink paints from physical section fragments with row, break-token, and repeat-occurrence identity that the final CSSOM-derived border rectangles do not carry; keeping currentProtocolExact false prevents a visually plausible but unauthenticated route from satisfying the logical gate. See docs/225-fragmented-collapsed-table-ownership.md and the bounded DM-2557 through DM-2560 follow-ups.",
